[STYLE]
Realistic Korean office comedy drama, 2000s K-drama look, warm fluorescent lighting,
beige cubicle partitions, cluttered desks with stacked binders, cinematic, 16:9,
natural film grain, slightly exaggerated comedic acting, no logos, no on-screen text.

[CHARACTERS]
- HERO: Korean man, late 20s, messy black hair, white shirt, many yellow-green sticky
  notes stuck on his back and shoulders.
- COLLEAGUE A: Korean woman, early 30s, long dark hair, black-rimmed glasses, beige cardigan.
- COLLEAGUE B: Korean man, early 30s, short black hair, light blue striped shirt.
- TEAM LEAD LEE: Korean man, late 40s, balding with gray sides, reading glasses,
  navy suit, pink tie.

[VOICES] (keep exactly the same voice for each character in every shot)
- HERO: young male, slightly high and nasal, whiny and flustered, standard Seoul Korean.
- COLLEAGUE A: female, early 30s, soft slightly husky voice, fast gossiping whisper.
- COLLEAGUE B: male, early 30s, light mid-pitch voice, easily shocked.
- TEAM LEAD LEE: male, late 40s, deep warm baritone, hearty laugh.
- NARRATOR: bright, clear female announcer voice, friendly and confident.
All dialogue is spoken in Korean.

[SHOTS]
Shot 1 (0-4s) Office pantry, medium shot from slightly behind. COLLEAGUE A and
COLLEAGUE B stand close holding paper coffee cups. COLLEAGUE A covers her mouth and
whispers, glancing toward the office:
  COLLEAGUE A (0-2s, whispering): "저 사람, 기획안 AI로 짰잖아. 말투가 너무 AI라서 우리가 싹 다 고쳤어."
  COLLEAGUE B (2-4s, eyes wide): "아… 그래서 이 팀장이 그렇게 한숨 쉰 거야?"

Shot 2 (4-8.5s) Locked-off static camera, over-the-shoulder from directly behind HERO
at his desk. His monitor shows a plain bright white blank screen, fully visible and
centered. His hands freeze above the keyboard, he slowly lifts his head and stares at
the screen, shoulders slumping:
  HERO (5.5-8.5s, muttering, wronged): "아니, 나는 이거 하나밖에 안 써 봤단 말이야…"

Shot 3 (8.5-11.5s) Same static angle. HERO flinches back in his chair, then leans in
close to the monitor:
  HERO (8.5s, gasp): "헉!"
  HERO (10-11.5s, disbelief): "AI 쓰는 걸 AI한테 맡긴다고?"

Shot 4 (11.5-15s) The camera pushes in smoothly past HERO's shoulder toward the monitor
until the bright white blank screen fills the entire frame and holds with a soft glow.
  NARRATOR (12.5-14.5s): "고르는 건 시엠프레가 할게요."

Light comic background music, quieter than the voices.
